---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="How to reach Budget Home Fixes to report an error, suggest a topic or ask about a guide."
>
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p>
    The fastest way to reach us is email:
    <a href="mailto:hello@thebudgethomefixes.com">hello@thebudgethomefixes.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What to write to us about</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Corrections.</strong> If a price, figure or source in a guide looks wrong or out of date, tell us which
      guide and which number, and include a link to where you saw the correct one if you can.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Topic requests.</strong> Tell us which home cost question you could not find a clear answer to.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Questions about a guide.</strong> We cannot give personal quotes or legal advice, but we can point you to
      the sources a guide used.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell placements, accept payment to recommend products or run sponsored posts. See
    <a href="/about">how our guides are made</a> for our approach to sources.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
